# HDRI environment variables
#
# HDRI sub-apps (factory, observatory, dashboard) load this .env automatically
# via @syrokomskyi/observatory-crypto/auto-env, which walks up from cwd until
# it finds a .env file. This file is the first match for all apps under apps/hdri/.
#
# Required for a-contract-ontology (observation signing):
#   DEVICE_ID          — operational collector identity (e.g. hostname, UUID)
#   DEVICE_SIGNING_KEY — base64-encoded PKCS8 PEM ed25519 private key
#
# Generate a signing key pair:
#   pnpm setup:device-id
#
# The matching public key is written to transparency/keys/<DEVICE_ID>.pem
# (committable) so downstream verifiers can audit signatures.

# Operational collector identity — hostname, UUID, or any short stable label.
# Do NOT prefix with "-" (leading dash marks a folder as ignored).
DEVICE_ID=
# Base64-encoded PKCS8 PEM ed25519 private key — generate with: pnpm setup:device-id
# Treat as secret — never commit. Public key goes to transparency/keys/<DEVICE_ID>.pem.
DEVICE_SIGNING_KEY=
